[I] Minimalistic IRC bot

[T] sircbot is a small IRC bot meant for use with git hooks, cron jobs and
[T] scripts. It joins the given channels and creates a unix socket per
[T] channel, so programs can post messages by writing to it; an optional Lua
[T] module is included.

[U] https://git.alpinelinux.org/cgit/sircbot/

